# UwULock's virtual security key: passkeys from the vault for browsers on Linux (Settings →
# Passkeys, off until switched on). Installed with UwULock's .deb, .rpm and the Arch package.
#
# /dev/uhid stays root's: UwULock's helper uwulock-uhid-broker (a systemd socket service) makes
# the key for the person at the seat, and nothing but the key. docs/passkeys.md has the design.
#
# Browsers talk to the key through its hidraw device: bus USB, vendor and product 0000, as only
# the broker creates it. systemd's 60-fido-id.rules finds it by its FIDO report descriptor too;
# this covers the rest.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", KERNELS=="0003:0000:0000.*", TAG+="uaccess"
